00:40:28.500 --> 00:40:30.960
we've taken the most high value
of those and we're actually

00:40:30.960 --> 00:40:35.100
focusing more on those and how
we can highlight them and scale them.

00:40:36.060 --> 00:40:37.320
Hope that answers
your question.

00:40:40.020 --> 00:40:43.140
And in the regulated environment,
that was a part of it.

00:40:44.400 --> 00:40:45.120
So

00:40:45.120 --> 00:40:49.920
honestly, we're a little
less regulated than human health

00:40:50.820 --> 00:40:51.660
