regulations in terms of clinical trials,

00:40:57.060 --> 00:40:57.660
registrations,

00:40:59.700 --> 00:41:00.420
we have to do

00:41:02.340 --> 00:41:02.820
GMP,

00:41:02.820 --> 00:41:05.340
all those kinds of things
on the manufacturing side as well.

