00:41:22.260 --> 00:41:25.440
- Yeah. Yeah, so we

00:41:25.440 --> 00:41:27.300
use we use a lot of
tools, I would say.

00:41:27.300 --> 00:41:31.080
We're trying to consolidate
into one kind of workspace.

00:41:31.080 --> 00:41:34.560
But we're not dictating to
every data scientist that you

00:41:34.560 --> 00:41:37.140
