have to use that language.

00:41:37.140 --> 00:41:39.180
We've got Python programmers,

00:41:39.180 --> 00:41:42.360
we've got R programmers that are
very strong in both of those.

00:41:42.360 --> 00:41:45.300
Posit's nice because it allows you
