00:41:45.900 --> 00:41:49.620
We also use Databricks
as a way to use

00:41:50.700 --> 00:41:52.920
Spark and Python code
or R code as well,

00:41:53.700 --> 00:41:54.840
but mainly Python.

00:41:54.840 --> 00:41:58.560
And a lot of the Azure tools
is what we use as well.

00:41:58.560 --> 00:42:00.300
So we're in Azure shop.

00:42:03.260 --> 00:42:04.967
SARANG: Thanks.

