00:52:02.940 --> 00:52:04.200
- Yeah, yeah.

00:52:05.160 --> 00:52:08.640
And the landscape has
drastically changed from when I

00:52:08.640 --> 00:52:10.080
was a grad student
20 years ago.

00:52:10.800 --> 00:52:12.120
So when I was a grad student,

00:52:12.120 --> 00:52:15.060
I did most of my
dissertation research in Sas,

00:52:15.060 --> 00:52:16.740
but I also use R.

00:52:16.740 --> 00:52:20.160
So hopefully not offending
any of the R people here. But

00:52:20.940 --> 00:52:22.980
yeah, so I did it in both.

00:52:22.980 --> 00:52:24.660
And since then,

00:52:24.660 --> 00:52:27.900
Python has become very
popular and more and more new

00:52:27.900 --> 00:52:29.880
